","statementID":"1434802003","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"因为我太饿了——以为我会这么说吗？不！因为我不想工作！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:5:1434802003":{"key":"choice_prompt:5:1434802003","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1434802003","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"因为我太饿了——以为我会这么说吗？不！因为我不想工作！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1434802004:1":{"key":"say:6:1434802004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1434802004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"当然，这是我坚定不移的立场，绝对不会因为饥饿而改变！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1434802006:1":{"key":"say:7:1434802006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1434802006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"而且，就算现在我想改变立场重新开始伟大的寻宝工作，但我...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1434802007:1":{"key":"say:8:1434802007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1434802007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"所以，拜托了，魔法师大人，我好饿，求你给我找点吃的吧……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1434802008:1":{"key":"say:9:1434802008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1434802008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"对了，我已经吃腻坚果了，麻烦你给我找条鱼来，不要钓上来...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:10:1434802008":{"key":"choice_prompt:10:1434802008","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1434802008","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"对了，我已经吃腻坚果了，麻烦你给我找条鱼来，不要钓上来的鲜鱼，要烤熟的鱼！最好是<style=highlight>烤熟的铁鳍鳟鱼</style>！烤全熟，最好焦一点。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1434802009:1":{"key":"say:11:1434802009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1434802009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"求你了，梅林大人，你难道愿意眼睁睁地看着一只无辜的小仓...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1434802010:1":{"key":"say:12:1434802010:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"143480201